---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';import {services,site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">A NEW CHAPTER IN CANADA</span><h1>Big dreams.<br/>Clear direction.<br/><em>Your Canada.</em></h1><p>Every journey is personal. Find your way forward with thoughtful work permit and visa support, built around you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/register/">Find your starting point <Icon size={18}/></a><a class="underlink" href="/how-it-works/">Discover our approach ↗</a></div><div class="hero-foot"><span class="circle-icon"><Icon name="shield" size={19}/></span><span>A personal approach.<br/><strong>From your first question to your next step.</strong></span></div></div><div class="hero-image"><img src="/images/toronto.webp" width="900" height="1000" alt="Toronto’s CN Tower and skyline at dusk" fetchpriority="high"/><span class="image-marker"><span class="pin"></span> TORONTO, ONTARIO <span>43.6532° N / 79.3832° W</span></span><div class="hero-caption"><span>NEW PLACES. NEW POSSIBILITIES.</span><p>Make room for<br/><em>what comes next.</em></p></div><div class="image-index">01 — CANADA</div></div></section>
<section class="trust-strip"><div class="container"><p>Personal guidance.<br/><strong>Practical next steps.</strong></p><div><Icon name="work"/><span>Work permit &<br/>visitor visa support</span></div><div><Icon name="shield"/><span>Clear scope &<br/>transparent conversations</span></div><a href={site.register} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check your representative<br/><strong>Visit the public register ↗</strong></a></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR PATH</span><h2>Different plans.<br/><em>The same personal attention.</em></h2></div><p>Your reason for coming to Canada is yours alone. Let’s understand it, and map out a considered next step.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map(s=><a class="service-card" href={`/services/${s.slug}/`}><div class="card-top"><span>{s.number} / {s.short.toUpperCase()}</span><Icon name={s.icon} size={33}/></div><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.description}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span>Explore {s.short.toLowerCase()}</span><span class="arrow-circle"><Icon size={19}/></span></div></a>)}</div><div class="subtle-note">Not sure where to start? <a href="/contact/">A conversation is a good first step ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="approach section"><div class="container approach-grid"><div class="approach-image"><img src="/images/canada.webp" alt="A quiet lake surrounded by the Canadian Rockies" width="700" height="800" loading="lazy"/><div class="image-label">A NEW PERSPECTIVE STARTS HERE.</div></div><div class="approach-copy"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR JOURNEY, CONSIDERED</span><h2>A big move.<br/><em>Smaller, clearer steps.</em></h2><p>Immigration can feel like a lot to take in. We bring the conversation back to you: your circumstances, your questions and what needs to happen next.</p><ol class="steps compact"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Tell us your plans</h3><p>A guided online registration helps us understand your starting point.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Understand your options</h3><p>Discuss your circumstances, service scope, documents and fees with Verto.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Move forward with clarity</h3><p>Agree on the next steps before proceeding with paid application support.</p></div></li></ol><a href="/how-it-works/" class="underlink">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section container promise"><span class="eyebrow">A RELATIONSHIP BUILT ON CLARITY</span><div class="promise-grid"><h2>Your plans matter.<br/><em>So does your peace of mind.</em></h2><div><p>Good guidance starts with honest conversations. Understand who you are working with, what your service includes, and what remains in the hands of immigration authorities.</p><a class="underlink" href="/about/">Get to know Verto ↗</a></div></div><div class="values"><div><span>01</span><h3>People before paperwork</h3><p>Your circumstances shape the conversation. We start by listening.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Clarity before commitment</h3><p>Discuss your service agreement, fees and refund terms before paying.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Honesty at every step</h3><p>No promise of a visa, a job or a guaranteed processing date.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="resources-band"><div class="container"><div><span class="eyebrow">START INFORMED</span><h2>A little preparation.<br/><em>A clearer conversation.</em></h2><p>Practical reading for the questions that come before the application.</p><a href="/resources/" class="underlink">Explore all resources ↗</a></div><div class="resource-links"><a href="/resources/before-you-apply/"><span>01 / GETTING STARTED</span><h3>Before you begin your registration</h3><Icon/></a><a href="/resources/verify-your-representative/"><span>02 / MAKING INFORMED CHOICES</span><h3>How to verify your immigration representative</h3><Icon/></a><a href="/fees/"><span>03 / UNDERSTANDING FEES</span><h3>Know what you are paying for</h3><Icon/></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section container faq-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE CLARITY</span><h2>Good questions.<br/><em>Clear answers.</em></h2><a href="/faq/" class="underlink">All frequently asked questions ↗</a></div><FAQ limit={4}/></section><CTA/>
</Layout>
